            "finish_reason": "stop",
            "message": {
              "role": "assistant",
              "content": "<summary>The QA March test bell rang once at the March Start Marker. The sound was a single, clear tone that echoed across the frozen tundra, marking the passage of time on New Year's Day. No characters moved, and no objects changed position.</summary>"
